{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "理解长方形面积与周长",
    "goals": [
      "理解面积是指用单位正方形覆盖平面区域的多少，并掌握平方单位的意义",
      "通过行列计数推导出长方形面积公式“面积 = 长 × 宽”",
      "区分面积与周长的概念及单位差异"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "直观演示：用 1 平方厘米的单位正方形铺满长方形，建立面积的直观图像",
      "计数关联：引导学习者发现“总方格数 = 每行方格数 × 行数”的对应关系",
      "对比深化：通过比较同一长方形的面积（内部覆盖）与周长（外围边长），消除两者的概念混淆"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 4,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 8,
        "label": "每行方格数（长）",
        "unit": "cm",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "initial": 3,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 6,
        "label": "行数（宽）",
        "unit": "cm",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立面积的概念：用单位正方形覆盖平面区域的多少",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "什么是面积？简而言之，面积就是测量一个平面图形内部占据了多少空间。我们通常用边长为 1 厘米的小正方形来作为量度标准，每个小正方形的面积称为 1 平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "rectangle_unit_square_array",
                  "numbers": [
                    1,
                    2
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 2
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "面积的含义",
                  "items": [
                    "1 平方厘米：边长为 1 厘米的正方形面积",
                    "面积：用标准单位正方形覆盖区域的总数量"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调单个单位正方形的大小和含义",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "看看眼前这个长方形，我们用这些 1 平方厘米的小正方形无重叠、无缝隙地把它铺满。数一数一共用了多少个小正方形，就能知道这个长方形的面积是多少。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 4,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "尝试调整每行的方格数（长），观察铺满长方形所需的单位正方形数量如何变化。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动滑动条，将长设置为 5 厘米。",
              "注意观察铺满一行需要多少个 1 平方厘米的小正方形。"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！你成功改变了长方形的长，直观看到了每行小正方形数量的变化。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 4.99,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "探索长方形行列计数与方格总数的乘法关系",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "请看这个长方形，它的长是4厘米，宽是3厘米。我们用边长为1厘米的单位正方形把它铺满。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "intent": "观察长方形的方格排列",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 2
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我们可以看到，沿着长的一边，每行正好摆放了4个小方格；沿着宽的一边，一共摆了这样的3行。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "分析每行方格数与行数的对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "要求出方格总数，不用一个一个数，直接用每行的4个乘以3行，就能算出总共是由12个小方格组成的。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "4 \\times 3 = 12"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 2
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "请尝试将长方形的每行方格数（长）调整为5厘米，观察方格总数的乘法关系。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动长（每行方格数）滑块至5。"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！每行5个方格，3行一共就是 5 × 3 = 15 个方格。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 4.99,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "推导长方形面积公式并掌握平方单位的应用",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在前几节发现，长方形里铺满的 1 平方厘米正方形总数，正好等于每行方格数乘以行数。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{面积} = \\text{长} \\times \\text{宽}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦公式推导结果",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "看现在的长方形，长是 4 厘米，宽是 3 厘米。每行有 4 个小正方形，共有 3 行，一共是 12 个小正方形。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "因此，它的面积就是 4 乘以 3 等于 12 平方厘米。记住，测量长度用厘米，表示覆盖的面积一定要用平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调面积单位平方厘米",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请你试着调整长方形的尺寸，验证一下“面积等于长乘宽”的规则吧。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "number_target",
            "prompt": "将长方形的长调整为 5 厘米。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动每行方格数（长）的滑块，将其改为 5。"
            ],
            "success_message": "非常好！长是 5 厘米，宽是 3 厘米，面积就是 5 × 3 = 15 平方厘米。",
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "number_controls": [
              {
                "number": 1,
                "controls": [
                  "slider"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "value": 4.99,
            "tolerance": 0.5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "区分面积与周长：概念、边界与测量单位",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们来清楚地区分面积与周长。看这个长为5厘米、宽为3厘米的长方形。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 5,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              },
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "number": 2,
                "end_value": 3,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "周长指的是围成图形一周的边缘总长度，就像沿着外框走一圈，单位是一维的厘米；而面积则是内部铺满单位正方形的多少，单位是二维的平方厘米。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "面积与周长的区别",
                  "items": [
                    "周长：封闭图形一周的长度（单位：厘米 cm）",
                    "面积：覆盖平面区域的大小（单位：平方厘米 cm²）"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "对比周长（边缘长度）与面积（内部覆盖）的区别",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
